ode_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDc2MDg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13476087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78","html_url":"https://github.com/bsil78","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsil78/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T14:04:35Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T14:07:35Z","body":"Twitch dev Babadesbois (author of Xion Leak, available on Steam and presented in some showcases) works on a new game with Godot 4.4.1, and he is complaining a lot on stream about resources related bugs in 4.4..1 ; here are related bug examples (maybe it is related to this ticket, maybe not) :\n- it happens that changing custom (subtyped) Resource in editor and launching game directly does not always show made changes ; but strangely all is correct after a restart of project\n- a lot of (maybe all) custom (subtyped) Resources are sometimes randomly altered by editor with no clue of what is triggering that ; Babadesbois need to git -r all concerned resources in order to fix the problem (luckily he uses git as a work basis)\n\nThus it really feels like a custom Resources cache corruption or malfunction...\n\nThat is very dangerous and extremely annoying for him and is really a bad buzz for Godot that should be fixed as quick a possible (and back ported if possible).\n\nThanks to all for the efforts made on Godot maintaining !","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3461718485/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]